## 继续保持的对象与状态边界

Origin7 闭键为 `kind/schemaVersion/state/ownership/recordPointer/continuation121/continuationReadback`；kind=`Root-runtime121-successful-prepare-origin`、schemaVersion=1、recordPointer=`/taxContinuation121`。S4 闭12与01完全一致，kind=`Root-runtime121-successful-prepare-adoption-handoff`、schemaVersion=3，`allowedPurpose='budget-probe'`。Adoption6 闭键为 `kind/schemaVersion/purpose/prepareOrigin121/current/semantics`；kind=`Root-runtime121-successful-prepare-adoption`、schemaVersion=1、purpose=`budget-probe`。其 current 闭5=`plan/registry/candidate/sourceWitness/scope121`；semantics 闭4=`freshPreparation/newK/actualContextObserved/FIOrNormalGranted`，四值均 false。

这些 false 是语义标签，**不承担权限隔离**。隔离由以下真实 Native 构造、私有 brand 和每个普通入口的中央拒绝执行。

